    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.extra\n\n### Description\n\nThe idea is to add a simple and easy to use undo tree to mini.extras. Are there other ones out there? Yes but having it in mini.extras is nice to have one plugin with many mini plugins than a bunch of big plugins",
